<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="th" class="h-full bg-gray-50">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>จัดการเว็บไซต์ - Lullapos Admin</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Prompt:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://cdn.quilljs.com/1.3.6/quill.snow.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <script src="https://cdn.quilljs.com/1.3.6/quill.min.js"></script>
    <style> 
        body { font-family: 'Prompt', sans-serif; } 
        .no-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
        .no-scrollbar { -ms-overflow-style: none; scrollbar-width: none; }
    </style>
    <script>
      tailwind.config = {
        theme: {
          extend: { colors: { primary: '<%= settings.theme_color %>' } }
        }
      }
      function previewImage(input, imgId) {
          if (input.files && input.files[0]) {
              var reader = new FileReader();
              reader.onload = function(e) { document.getElementById(imgId).src = e.target.result; }
              reader.readAsDataURL(input.files[0]);
          }
      }
    </script>
</head>
<body class="h-full overflow-hidden flex">

    <div id="mobile-sidebar-backdrop" class="fixed inset-0 z-40 hidden bg-gray-900/80 transition-opacity md:hidden" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <aside id="sidebar" class="fixed inset-y-0 left-0 z-50 flex w-72 -translate-x-full flex-col bg-gray-900 transition-transform duration-300 ease-in-out md:static md:translate-x-0">
        <div class="flex h-16 shrink-0 items-center bg-gray-900 px-6 border-b border-gray-800">
            <span class="text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-wide">Lulla<span class="text-primary">pos</span> <span class="text-xs text-gray-400 font-normal ml-1">Admin</span></span>
            <button id="close-sidebar-btn" type="button" class="ml-auto flex items-center justify-center text-gray-400 hover:text-white md:hidden">
                <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12" /></svg>
            </button>
        </div>

        <nav class="flex flex-1 flex-col overflow-y-auto no-scrollbar px-4 py-6">
            <ul role="list" class="flex flex-1 flex-col gap-y-7">
                <li>
                    <div class="text-xs font-semibold leading-6 text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">จัดการหน้า Landing Page</div>
                    <ul role="list" class="-mx-2 space-y-1">
                        <li><button type="button" class="sidebar-menu-btn w-full flex gap-x-3 rounded-md p-2 text-sm font-semibold leading-6 text-gray-400 hover:bg-gray-800 hover:text-white transition-colors" data-target="tab-layout">⇅ โครงสร้างหน้าเว็บ</button></li>
                        <li><button type="button" class="sidebar-menu-btn w-full flex gap-x-3 rounded-md p-2 text-sm font-semibold leading-6 text-gray-400 hover:bg-gray-800 hover:text-white transition-colors" data-target="tab-general">1. ทั่วไป & Footer</button></li>
                        <li><button type="button" class="sidebar-menu-btn w-full flex gap-x-3 rounded-md p-2 text-sm font-semibold leading-6 text-gray-400 hover:bg-gray-800 hover:text-white transition-colors" data-target="tab-hero">2. ส่วนบนสุด (Hero)</button></li>
                        <li><button type="button" class="sidebar-menu-btn w-full flex gap-x-3 rounded-md p-2 text-sm font-semibold leading-6 text-gray-400 hover:bg-gray-800 hover:text-white transition-colors" data-target="tab-features3">3. วิสัยทัศน์</button></li>
                        <li><button type="button" class="sidebar-menu-btn w-full flex gap-x-3 rounded-md p-2 text-sm font-semibold leading-6 text-gray-400 hover:bg-gray-800 hover:text-white transition-colors" data-target="tab-features4">4. ฟีเจอร์หลัก</button></li>
                        <li><button type="button" class="sidebar-menu-btn w-full flex gap-x-3 rounded-md p-2 text-sm font-semibold leading-6 text-gray-400 hover:bg-gray-800 hover:text-white transition-colors" data-target="tab-stats">5. ภารกิจและสถิติ</button></li>
                        <li><button type="button" class="sidebar-menu-btn w-full flex gap-x-3 rounded-md p-2 text-sm font-semibold leading-6 text-gray-400 hover:bg-gray-800 hover:text-white transition-colors" data-target="tab-faq">6. คำถามที่พบบ่อย (FAQ)</button></li>
                        <li><button type="button" class="sidebar-menu-btn w-full flex gap-x-3 rounded-md p-2 text-sm font-semibold leading-6 text-gray-400 hover:bg-gray-800 hover:text-white transition-colors" data-target="tab-cta">7. ส่วนเชิญชวน (CTA)</button></li>
                        <li><button type="button" class="sidebar-menu-btn w-full flex gap-x-3 rounded-md p-2 text-sm font-semibold leading-6 text-gray-400 hover:bg-gray-800 hover:text-white transition-colors" data-target="tab-banner">8. โฆษณา Modal</button></li>
                        <li><button type="button" class="sidebar-menu-btn w-full flex gap-x-3 rounded-md p-2 text-sm font-semibold leading-6 text-gray-400 hover:bg-gray-800 hover:text-white transition-colors" data-target="tab-seo">9. ตั้งค่า SEO</button></li>
                        <li><button type="button" class="sidebar-menu-btn w-full flex gap-x-3 rounded-md p-2 text-sm font-semibold leading-6 text-gray-400 hover:bg-gray-800 hover:text-white transition-colors" data-target="tab-article-cta">10. CTA หน้าบทความ</button></li>
                    </ul>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <div class="text-xs font-semibold leading-6 text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">บทความ & คอนเทนต์</div>
                    <ul role="list" class="-mx-2 space-y-1">
                        <li><button type="button" class="sidebar-menu-btn w-full flex gap-x-3 rounded-md p-2 text-sm font-semibold leading-6 text-primary bg-primary/10 hover:bg-gray-800 hover:text-white transition-colors" data-target="tab-blog" id="btn-blog">📝 11. จัดการบทความ (Blog)</button></li>
                    </ul>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </nav>
    </aside>

    <div class="flex flex-col flex-1 w-0 overflow-hidden bg-gray-50">
        <header class="flex items-center justify-between h-16 px-4 bg-white border-b border-gray-200 shadow-sm sm:px-6 lg:px-8 shrink-0 relative z-10">
            <button id="open-sidebar-btn" type="button" class="text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-700 md:hidden">
                <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3.75 6.75h16.5M3.75 12h16.5m-16.5 5.25H12" /></svg>
            </button>
            <h1 class="hidden text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 md:block" id="page-title-display">1. ทั่วไป & Footer</h1>
            
            <div class="flex items-center ml-auto space-x-4">
                <div class="relative ml-3">
                    <button id="user-menu-btn" type="button" class="flex items-center bg-white rounded-full focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary">
                        <img class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full object-cover border border-gray-200" src="https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Admin&background=random&color=fff" alt="Admin">
                    </button>
                    <div id="user-dropdown-panel" class="absolute right-0 z-10 hidden w-48 py-1 mt-2 bg-white rounded-md shadow-lg ring-1 ring-black ring-opacity-5">
                        <a href="/" target="_blank" class="block px-4 py-2 text-sm text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-100">ดูหน้าเว็บไซต์จริง</a>
                        <a href="/admin/login" class="block px-4 py-2 text-sm text-red-600 hover:bg-red-50">ออกจากระบบ</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </header>

        <main class="flex-1 relative overflow-y-auto focus:outline-none">
            <div class="py-6 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 mx-auto max-w-5xl">
                
                <form action="/admin/save" method="POST" enctype="multipart/form-data" class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-200" id="main-settings-form">
                    <div class="px-6 py-4 border-b border-gray-200 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between sticky top-0 bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-sm z-20 rounded-t-xl">
                        <div>
                            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">กรุณากดบันทึกทุกครั้งเมื่อแก้ไขข้อมูลเสร็จสิ้น</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mt-4 sm:mt-0">
                            <button type="submit" class="inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-primary px-6 py-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-md hover:opacity-80 transition-all transform hover:scale-105">
                                💾 บันทึกการเปลี่ยนแปลง
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="p-6">
                        
                        <div id="tab-layout" class="tab-content space-y-4 hidden">
                            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">จัดลำดับส่วนต่างๆ ของหน้าแรก เลือกซ่อน/แสดง และเลือกสีพื้นหลังของแต่ละส่วน (เนื้อหาของแต่ละส่วนแก้ได้ที่เมนูของส่วนนั้น)</p>
                            <div id="layout-container" class="space-y-2"></div>
                            <input type="hidden" name="section_order" id="section_order_input" value="<%= settings.section_order %>">
                        </div>

                        <div id="tab-general" class="tab-content space-y-6">
                            <div><label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">ชื่อเว็บไซต์ (ใช้ใน og:site_name และท้ายชื่อหน้าบทความ)</label><input type="text" name="site_name" value="<%= settings.site_name %>" class="w-full border-gray-300 rounded-md border p-2 text-sm"></div>
                            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 bg-gray-50/50 p-6 rounded-lg border border-gray-100">
                                <div>
                                    <label class="block text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-2">Favicon (PNG/ICO)</label>
                                    <input type="file" name="favicon" accept="image/*" onchange="previewImage(this, 'preview-favicon')" class="w-full text-sm text-gray-500 file:mr-4 file:py-2 file:px-4 file:rounded-md file:border-0 file:text-sm file:font-semibold file:bg-primary file:text-white hover:file:bg-opacity-80">
                                    <div class="mt-3">
                                        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mb-1">รูปภาพปัจจุบันที่แสดงผล:</p>
                                        <img id="preview-favicon" src="<%= settings.favicon_url %>" class="h-10 w-auto object-contain rounded border border-gray-200 shadow-sm bg-white p-1">
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div>
                                    <label class="block text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-2">Logo โปร่งใส (PNG)</label>
                                    <input type="file" name="logo" accept="image/png" onchange="previewImage(this, 'preview-logo')" class="w-full text-sm text-gray-500 file:mr-4 file:py-2 file:px-4 file:rounded-md file:border-0 file:text-sm file:font-semibold file:bg-primary file:text-white hover:file:bg-opacity-80">
                                    <div class="mt-3">
                                        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mb-1">รูปภาพปัจจุบันที่แสดงผล:</p>
                                        <img id="preview-logo" src="<%= settings.logo_url %>" class="h-12 w-auto object-contain rounded border border-gray-200 shadow-sm bg-gray-100 p-1">
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            
                            <div>
                                <label class="block text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-2">สีธีมหลัก (เช่น <code>rgb(244 97 100 / 98%)</code> หรือ <code>#F46164</code>)</label>
                                <input type="text" name="theme_color" value="<%= settings.theme_color %>" class="w-full border-gray-300 rounded-md shadow-sm border p-2" required>
                            </div>
                            
                            <div class="pt-6 border-t border-gray-200">
                                <h4 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">ตั้งค่า Footer & โซเชียล</h4>
                                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                                    <div><label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">ลิงก์ Facebook</label><input type="url" name="facebook_url" value="<%= settings.facebook_url %>" class="w-full border-gray-300 rounded-md shadow-sm border p-2 text-sm"></div>
                                    <div><label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">ไอคอน Facebook (SVG)</label><textarea name="facebook_icon" rows="2" class="w-full border-gray-300 rounded-md shadow-sm border p-2 text-xs font-mono"><%= settings.facebook_icon %></textarea></div>
                                    <div><label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">ลิงก์ LINE</label><input type="url" name="line_url" value="<%= settings.line_url %>" class="w-full border-gray-300 rounded-md shadow-sm border p-2 text-sm"></div>
                                    <div><label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">ไอคอน LINE (SVG)</label><textarea name="line_icon" rows="2" class="w-full border-gray-300 rounded-md shadow-sm border p-2 text-xs font-mono"><%= settings.line_icon %></textarea></div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="mt-4">
                                    <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">ข้อความ Copyright</label>
                                    <input type="text" name="footer_text" value="<%= settings.footer_text %>" class="w-full border-gray-300 rounded-md shadow-sm border p-2 text-sm" required>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div id="tab-hero" class="tab-content space-y-6 hidden">
                            <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                                <h4 class="font-semibold">บล็อก Hero (<span id="hero-count">0</span> บล็อก)</h4>
                                <button type="button" id="add-hero-btn" class="bg-white px-3 py-2 text-sm border rounded hover:bg-gray-50">+ เพิ่มบล็อก</button>
                            </div>
                            <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">แต่ละบล็อกเลือกเลย์เอาต์ได้เอง และเรียงต่อกันจากบนลงล่างบนหน้าเว็บ</p>
                            <p id="hero-empty" class="text-sm text-gray-500 bg-gray-50 border border-dashed rounded p-4 text-center hidden">ยังไม่มีบล็อก กดปุ่ม "+ เพิ่มบล็อก" เพื่อเริ่มสร้าง</p>
                            <div id="hero-container" class="space-y-6"></div>
                            <input type="hidden" name="hero_list" id="hero_list_input" value="<%= settings.hero_list %>">
                        </div>

                        <div id="tab-features3" class="tab-content space-y-6 hidden">
                            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                                <div><label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">หัวข้อหลัก</label><input type="text" name="feature_title" value="<%= settings.feature_title %>" class="w-full border-gray-300 rounded-md border p-2 text-sm" required></div>
                                <div><label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">คำโปรยย่อย (Subtitle)</label><input type="text" name="feature_subtitle" value="<%= settings.feature_subtitle %>" class="w-full border-gray-300 rounded-md border p-2 text-sm" required></div>
                                <div><label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">ข้อความ Badge</label><input type="text" name="feature_badge" value="<%= settings.feature_badge %>" class="w-full border-gray-300 rounded-md border p-2 text-sm"></div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-6 border-t border-gray-200">
                                <div>
                                    <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">เลย์เอาต์ (Template)</label>
                                    <select name="col_template" id="col_template" onchange="toggleSectionImage('col')" class="w-full border-gray-300 rounded-md border p-2 text-sm">
                                        <% templates.features.forEach(function(t) { %>
                                        <option value="<%= t.id %>" <%= settings.col_template === t.id ? 'selected' : '' %>><%= t.name %></option>
                                        <% }); %>
                                    </select>
                                    <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">เลือกรูปแบบการจัดวางของส่วนวิสัยทัศน์</p>
                                </div>
                                <div id="col_image_wrap" class="hidden">
                                    <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">ภาพประกอบของเลย์เอาต์นี้</label>
                                    <input type="file" accept="image/*" onchange="uploadSectionImage(event, 'col')" class="w-full text-sm text-gray-500 file:mr-4 file:py-2 file:px-4 file:rounded-md file:border-0 file:text-sm file:font-semibold file:bg-primary file:text-white hover:file:bg-opacity-80">
                                    <p id="col_img_status" class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1"></p>
                                    <input type="hidden" name="col_img_url" id="col_img_url" value="<%= settings.col_img_url %>">
                                    <img id="col_img_preview" src="<%= settings.col_img_url %>" class="mt-2 max-h-28 w-auto rounded border border-gray-200 <%= settings.col_img_url ? '' : 'hidden' %>">
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="pt-6 border-t border-gray-200">
                                <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-4">
                                    <h4 class="font-semibold">รายการคอลัมน์ (<span id="col-count">0</span> รายการ)</h4>
                                    <button type="button" id="add-col-btn" class="bg-white px-3 py-2 text-sm border rounded hover:bg-gray-50">+ เพิ่มคอลัมน์</button>
                                </div>
                                <p id="col-empty" class="text-sm text-gray-500 bg-gray-50 border border-dashed rounded p-4 text-center hidden">ยังไม่มีคอลัมน์ กดปุ่ม "+ เพิ่มคอลัมน์" เพื่อเริ่มเพิ่มรายการ</p>
                                <div id="col-container" class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6"></div>
                                <input type="hidden" name="col_list" id="col_list_input" value="<%= settings.col_list %>">
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div id="tab-features4" class="tab-content space-y-6 hidden">
                            <div class="space-y-4">
                                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                                    <div><label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">ข้อความ Badge</label><input type="text" name="grid_badge" value="<%= settings.grid_badge %>" class="w-full border-gray-300 rounded-md border p-2 text-sm" required></div>
                                    <div><label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">หัวข้อหลัก</label><input type="text" name="grid_title" value="<%= settings.grid_title %>" class="w-full border-gray-300 rounded-md border p-2 text-sm" required></div>
                                </div>
                                <div><label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">รายละเอียด</label><input type="hidden" name="grid_desc" id="grid_desc"><div class="quill-editor bg-white rounded-b-md" data-target="grid_desc" style="height: 100px;"><%- settings.grid_desc %></div></div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-6 border-t border-gray-200">
                                <div>
                                    <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">เลย์เอาต์ (Template)</label>
                                    <select name="grid_template" id="grid_template" onchange="toggleSectionImage('grid')" class="w-full border-gray-300 rounded-md border p-2 text-sm">
                                        <% templates.features.forEach(function(t) { %>
                                        <option value="<%= t.id %>" <%= settings.grid_template === t.id ? 'selected' : '' %>><%= t.name %></option>
                                        <% }); %>
                                    </select>
                                    <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">เลือกรูปแบบการจัดวางของส่วนฟีเจอร์หลัก</p>
                                </div>
                                <div id="grid_image_wrap" class="hidden">
                                    <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">ภาพประกอบของเลย์เอาต์นี้</label>
                                    <input type="file" accept="image/*" onchange="uploadSectionImage(event, 'grid')" class="w-full text-sm text-gray-500 file:mr-4 file:py-2 file:px-4 file:rounded-md file:border-0 file:text-sm file:font-semibold file:bg-primary file:text-white hover:file:bg-opacity-80">
                                    <p id="grid_img_status" class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1"></p>
                                    <input type="hidden" name="grid_img_url" id="grid_img_url" value="<%= settings.grid_img_url %>">
                                    <img id="grid_img_preview" src="<%= settings.grid_img_url %>" class="mt-2 max-h-28 w-auto rounded border border-gray-200 <%= settings.grid_img_url ? '' : 'hidden' %>">
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="pt-6 border-t border-gray-200">
                                <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-4">
                                    <h4 class="font-semibold">รายการฟีเจอร์ (<span id="grid-count">0</span> รายการ)</h4>
                                    <button type="button" id="add-grid-btn" class="bg-white px-3 py-2 text-sm border rounded hover:bg-gray-50">+ เพิ่มฟีเจอร์</button>
                                </div>
                                <p id="grid-empty" class="text-sm text-gray-500 bg-gray-50 border border-dashed rounded p-4 text-center hidden">ยังไม่มีฟีเจอร์ กดปุ่ม "+ เพิ่มฟีเจอร์" เพื่อเริ่มเพิ่มรายการ</p>
                                <div id="grid-container" class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6"></div>
                                <input type="hidden" name="grid_list" id="grid_list_input" value="<%= settings.grid_list %>">
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div id="tab-stats" class="tab-content space-y-6 hidden">
                            <div class="bg-gray-50/50 p-6 rounded-lg border border-gray-100 mb-6">
                                <label class="block text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-2">รูปภาพประกอบ (ฝั่งซ้าย)</label>
                                <input type="file" name="stats_img" accept="image/*" onchange="previewImage(this, 'preview-stats')" class="w-full text-sm text-gray-500 file:mr-4 file:py-2 file:px-4 file:rounded-md file:border-0 file:text-sm file:font-semibold file:bg-primary file:text-white hover:file:bg-opacity-80">
                                <div class="mt-4">
                                    <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mb-1">รูปภาพปัจจุบันที่แสดงผล:</p>
